5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"It is a pleasure to work with you all. To ensure our plan is realistic, I would like to look into the site diaries and the delivery schedules.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Yumi,,I'm so excited to help! I want to check the booking data for rooms and the timetable records for rooms out of service.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,George,,I believe we should consider the human element. I will examine the staffing posts since the hiring freeze and the bench technicians' weekly manual routines.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,I agree we need a logical basis. I'll look into the post-occupancy review ratings and the survey findings in the older blocks.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,A prudent start. I shall investigate the tender records over three budget cycles and the renewal reserve for equipment bought earlier.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
